= RDF test data: Notation3 (.n3)

Notation3 serialization samples. Both files are collected from public sources.

ddot.it/this ..format.. format:notation3
ddot.it/this ..content.. Notation3 (N3) RDF documents collected from DBpedia and the W3C

# dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..format.. format:notation3
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Karlsruhe serialized as Notation3
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..depicts.. the German city Karlsruhe (DBpedia resource)
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..tests.. real-world multilingual entity data, language-tagged literals, typed literals, many prefixes
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.n3 ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 and GNU FDL

# w3c-timbl-card.n3
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..kind.. collected
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..format.. format:notation3
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..content.. Tim Berners-Lee's public FOAF profile card written in Notation3
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..depicts.. Tim Berners-Lee (personal FOAF profile)
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..tests.. FOAF/DOAP vocabularies, default ':' prefix, comments, real-world N3 document
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/People/Berners-Lee/card
w3c-timbl-card.n3 ..license.. W3C Software and Document License
